{
  "$defs": {
    "OutboundRecallState": {
      "description": "**她自己**发出去的消息，被主动撤回的结果。\n\n与入站的 :class:`RecallEvent` 是两件事：那个是\"对方收回了什么\"，\n这个是\"我们把已经发出去的那条收回来\"。混用会让\"谁撤回的\"永远说不清。\n\n五个取值都必须能区分，因为它们对用户的含义完全不同：\n\n- ``recalled``：平台确认已撤回（**唯一**可以说\"撤回了\"的状态）；\n- ``not_found``：平台上已经没有这条（可能早被删、id 过期）；\n- ``expired``：超过平台允许的撤回时间窗，**根本没发 action**；\n- ``unsupported``：这个接入方式不支持撤回（QQ 官方机器人）；\n- ``uncertain``：没拿到回执，**不确定**是否撤回成功——不许说成功。",
      "enum": [
        "recalled",
        "not_found",
        "expired",
        "unsupported",
        "uncertain"
      ],
      "title": "OutboundRecallState",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/RecallReceipt.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次撤回尝试的**平台回执**（\"没有回执不声称已撤回\"）。\n\n``detail`` 是给人看的一句话（不含消息正文）；``attempts`` 让调用方能说清\n\"我们试过几次\"——重试不重复撤回，但\"试过\"本身是事实。",
  "properties": {
    "channel": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Channel",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "detail": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Detail"
    },
    "observed_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Observed At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "platform_message_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Platform Message Id"
    },
    "receipt_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Receipt Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "v1",
      "default": "v1",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "state": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/OutboundRecallState"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "receipt_id",
    "channel",
    "state",
    "observed_at"
  ],
  "title": "RecallReceipt",
  "type": "object",
  "x-ling-schema-version": "v1"
}
